{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "考试前最后一天，星期一。", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一早还是惯例的全校集会。", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘──不过，下周开始暂时没有全校集会了喔。理由很不识趣所以大家不要问。’", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 147, "voice": "rk0050", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然是惯例，但暂时就到今天为止的样子。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "台上的学园长伸手示意大家安静，然后耸了耸肩。", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她沉默地环视台下的学生们。", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平时总是煽动学生情绪的学园长，今天……好像有点不一样？", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本不满的学生也逐渐察觉到了异常，大家的视线都集中在学园长身上。", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……那么！明天起就是考试，大家都知道吧？’", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 147, "voice": "rk0051", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "抓准这个绝妙的时机，学园长换了一个话题。", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的演讲力真不是盖的，学生们都被她牵引着情绪。", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘好女人必须具备知性。虽然即使笨一点男孩子也能接受……’", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 147, "voice": "rk0052", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘但是既然现在身为结女的一员，就必须遵从我们的理念。’", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 147, "voice": "rk0053", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是说，请各位考试加油。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这句话不必说出口也传达到了每个人心中。所有学生们都一起绷紧了神经。", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不能让学园长看到自己糟糕的模样……的感觉。", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──啊啊，这就是考试前的结女的气氛啊。", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……结女的各位平常就听我说过了，现在再提一次。’", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 147, "voice": "rk0054", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长在讲台上优雅地微笑。", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘人类这种生物，随时都在寻找“另一半”。’", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 147, "voice": "rk0055", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘所以，为了相遇的那一刻，成为一个好女人吧！’", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 147, "voice": "rk0056", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 157, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "让人印象深刻的一句话呢。", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那什么感佩的表情啊。你想成为好女人吗？”", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 158, "voice": "ar0546", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇好恶。”", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 160, "voice": "sn0098", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾同学有女装癖啊。”", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 153, "voice": "ag0278", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果我是M的话新吾是女装癖啊～”", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 166, "voice": "ht0156", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂。”", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 157, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
